pi-v4-anchor adapts the Minimal-anchored bootstrap concept and selected prompt/tool
text from pi-deepseek-anchor:

  https://github.com/kxh4892636/pi-deepseek-anchor
  reviewed revision d369f966c63098202a49207fdc06cc575de47490

pi-deepseek-anchor is a Pi port of dsh-anchored-standard:

  https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard

That project adapts the DeepSeek Harness Standard agent preset:

  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
  revision 47f943859bef60e4160492346772ded9b24f765a

This implementation was independently reworked around Pi 0.84.2 public extension APIs,
OpenAI Responses payloads, reversible runtime state, and native Windows/MSYS paths.

